          %h2#idea Idea
          %p
            A
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category"} category
            is
            %em extensive
            if it has
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coproducts"} coproducts
            that interact well with a certain class of
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pullbacks"} pullbacks
            = succeed "," do
              %em lextensive
            = succeed "," do
              %em disjunctive
            %em positive
            categories. All of these come in
            %em finitary
            and
            %em infinitary
            versions (and, more generally,
            = succeed "-ary" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi κ
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \kappa
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/arity+class"} arity class
            = succeed ")." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi κ
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \kappa
